  "title": "Update RTPS dissector to support type alias",
  "description": "This pull request introduces support for the PID related to type aliases. This is a similar change we made for topic alias.\n\nThe following changes have been made:\nAdd PID_TYPE_NAME_ALIASES with the value 0x8029 to the list of PID definitions.\n- Add static int flags fields (hf_rtps_param_type_alias_num, hf_rtps_param_type_alias)\n- Add the string value for the PID\n- Dissect the string sequence for type alias (rtps_util_add_seq_string())\n- Register the flags under proto_register_rtps",
